  (text "CIRCUIT main board - schematic status\n\nDrawn (draft, from KiCad library pinouts): 2 USB-C input; 3 Haptics, buttons, debug; 4 Main MCU\n\nNot drawn yet:\n- Charger, battery, fuel gauge; 3V3 buck-boost, load switches, backlight driver;\n  secure element; NFC; BLE module - these need pinouts from datasheets (no library symbols)\n- Display and touch connectors - need the chosen panel's FPC pinout\n\nSignals between sheets use global labels. No routing before this schematic is complete and reviewed."
